      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Nutcracker syndrome (NCS), a rare clinical entity, when refractory to medical management warrants surgical intervention. In the following discussion, we present a case of NCS which was managed successfully by left renal vein transposition using a decompression shunt."
